{
  "comment": "Seccomp profile of the document-sandbox container (#703); see deploy/seccomp/README.md. Same semantics as Docker's default profile (an allowlist, anything else fails with EPERM rather than killing the process, so a missing syscall shows up as an error), but only what CPython, pypdf/pdfplumber, pypdfium2 and Pillow need to parse and render, the asyncio Unix-socket server and the fork/exec of its child (python -I). No network sockets, no ptrace, mount, namespaces, keyctl, bpf, io_uring or module loading. Native 64-bit ABI only (no x86/x32 compatibility syscalls).",
